1
00:01:37,770 --> 00:01:42,990
[Spring of The Blade]

2
00:01:43,310 --> 00:01:45,880
[Episode 21]

3
00:01:46,710 --> 00:01:48,570
I, Li Congxin, swear here and now:

4
00:01:48,920 --> 00:01:49,920
in this life,

5
00:01:50,640 --> 00:01:52,229
I will marry only you as my wife

6
00:01:52,229 --> 00:01:53,759
and never take a concubine.

7
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:55,789
I will never let you relive the tragedy

8
00:01:55,789 --> 00:01:59,320
your mother endured
amid the intrigues of the inner household.

9
00:02:06,680 --> 00:02:07,680
It's just that...

10
00:02:08,240 --> 00:02:11,300
the daughter-in-law
your mother has always wanted...

11
00:02:11,870 --> 00:02:12,870
isn't me,

12
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:15,470
but Second Sister.

13
00:02:15,590 --> 00:02:16,590
Of course not.

14
00:02:20,960 --> 00:02:21,820
Fourth Sister,

15
00:02:22,079 --> 00:02:22,870
don't worry.

16
00:02:23,150 --> 00:02:23,810
I'll go back

17
00:02:24,150 --> 00:02:25,710
and have a proper talk with my mother.

18
00:02:25,710 --> 00:02:26,520
In this life,

19
00:02:26,750 --> 00:02:29,010
I will marry no one but you, Xie Qingyuan.

20
00:02:31,150 --> 00:02:32,079
So...

21
00:02:37,310 --> 00:02:38,520
will you marry me?

22
00:03:10,150 --> 00:03:11,870
Can't you just sit still

23
00:03:11,870 --> 00:03:13,240
for a moment?

24
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:15,000
Whatever it is, let's sit down and talk.

25
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:16,190
I'm troubled!

26
00:03:16,520 --> 00:03:18,430
Madam Hu has been telling me all along

27
00:03:18,430 --> 00:03:20,030
that our son's match
would be with their second daughter.

28
00:03:20,030 --> 00:03:21,030
But today, Chunzhi

29
00:03:21,030 --> 00:03:22,590
made it clear to
their fourth daughter, Xie Qingyuan,

30
00:03:22,590 --> 00:03:24,450
that he would marry no one but her.

31
00:03:24,520 --> 00:03:25,710
What should we do?

32
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:28,680
Our son has always been free-spirited.

33
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:31,750
It's rare for him to care this much
about who he marries.

34
00:03:31,910 --> 00:03:33,400
Just let him have his way.

35
00:03:33,910 --> 00:03:34,840
Marquis,

36
00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:36,890
that's not what you said last time!

37
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:40,240
I hit you too hard?

38
00:03:40,710 --> 00:03:41,770
I'm fine, I'm fine.

39
00:03:42,120 --> 00:03:44,360
It's not that I insist on
a highborn lady for our son.

40
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:45,870
Our son is simple-hearted.

41
00:03:45,870 --> 00:03:47,930
Xie Qingyuan doesn't truly love him.

42
00:03:48,280 --> 00:03:49,810
If they really get married,

43
00:03:49,870 --> 00:03:51,710
there'll be no end of friction
down the road.

44
00:03:51,710 --> 00:03:53,570
Doesn't it hurt to think about it?

45
00:03:54,710 --> 00:03:57,440
Though she isn't
the principal wife's daughter,

46
00:03:57,520 --> 00:03:59,190
she conducts herself with prudence

47
00:03:59,190 --> 00:04:00,960
and propriety.

48
00:04:01,360 --> 00:04:03,310
If this marriage goes through,

49
00:04:03,310 --> 00:04:06,190
she will never do our son wrong.

50
00:04:08,590 --> 00:04:10,520
Changing your tune just like that.

51
00:04:17,829 --> 00:04:18,829
Fine, fine.

52
00:04:19,360 --> 00:04:21,000
Since Chunzhi has made up his mind,

53
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:23,400
I can't tear these lovebirds apart, right?

54
00:04:26,190 --> 00:04:27,510
I agree to this marriage

55
00:04:27,510 --> 00:04:29,370
because it is with the Xie family,

56
00:04:29,430 --> 00:04:30,800
not because it is with Fourth Lady Xie.

57
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:31,720
Exactly.

58
00:04:33,159 --> 00:04:33,920
Alright.

59
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:36,620
Then let's prepare the betrothal gifts.

60
00:04:36,750 --> 00:04:38,120
Our son is getting married.

61
00:04:38,120 --> 00:04:40,000
The gifts mustn't be skimped on,

62
00:04:40,070 --> 00:04:41,680
lest we become a laughingstock.

63
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:43,270
Don't you think so?

64
00:04:49,190 --> 00:04:52,190
Sooner or later, you and our son
will be the death of me.

65
00:04:54,680 --> 00:04:57,390
My son is getting married.

66
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:04,680
Come on, come and see.

67
00:05:05,870 --> 00:05:07,520
Why are there so many things?

68
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:09,310
Gosh, there are 2 whole rows.

69
00:05:11,190 --> 00:05:12,040
I like that one.

70
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:13,430
I like that hairpin.

71
00:05:13,370 --> 00:05:15,470
[Moonlight Casts Its Radiance]

72
00:05:14,920 --> 00:05:16,870
I still remember that day
at the Spring Banquet,

73
00:05:16,870 --> 00:05:19,310
when Chunzhi
rode his horse and shot arrows.

74
00:05:19,310 --> 00:05:20,750
He was truly impressive.

75
00:05:20,940 --> 00:05:26,210
[Moonlight Casts Its Radiance]

76
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:22,510
From that day on,

77
00:05:22,510 --> 00:05:23,950
I made up my mind

78
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:26,340
that I'd marry him no matter what.

79
00:05:26,430 --> 00:05:28,890
Second Sister,
you'll surely get your wish.

80
00:05:29,630 --> 00:05:30,680
Of course.

81
00:05:33,190 --> 00:05:34,680
What do you suppose Chunzhi

82
00:05:34,680 --> 00:05:36,750
has been doing these past few days?

83
00:05:37,070 --> 00:05:39,120
I'd guess Chunzhi...

84
00:05:40,390 --> 00:05:41,990
has been thinking about you.

85
00:05:43,070 --> 00:05:44,120
My Lady!

86
00:05:44,870 --> 00:05:45,870
My Lady!

87
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:52,780
The Marquis of Danyang household
has come to formally propose marriage!

88
00:05:59,560 --> 00:06:00,430
Move aside now!

89
00:06:01,750 --> 00:06:03,830
Look at all these gifts. Who do you think

90
00:06:03,830 --> 00:06:05,000
they are for?

91
00:06:05,070 --> 00:06:07,270
Which young lady could be so fortunate?

92
00:06:08,360 --> 00:06:09,940
Isn't it obvious?

93
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:11,830
Of course, it's for our Second Lady,

94
00:06:11,830 --> 00:06:13,720
from the Heir of the Marquis of Danyang.

95
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:14,510
Exactly.

96
00:06:14,680 --> 00:06:15,920
For Second Lady.

97
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:17,720
Second Lady is so lucky.

98
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:19,160
Old Madam has arrived!

99
00:06:30,310 --> 00:06:31,750
The Marquis of Danyang household

100
00:06:31,750 --> 00:06:34,680
respectfully addresses
the honorable Xie family.

101
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:37,920
[Formal Marriage Contract]

102
00:06:35,070 --> 00:06:37,480
With reverence,
heaven unfurls its brocade clouds,

103
00:06:37,480 --> 00:06:39,040
and earth brings forth its finest jade,

104
00:06:39,040 --> 00:06:41,000
and so a house of noble lineage
now comes forward.

105
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:44,000
Li Congxin, Heir to the
Marquisate of Danyang, comes from a family

106
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:45,870
that has upheld honor
and distinguished service for generations.

107
00:06:45,870 --> 00:06:47,830
He is a man of noble character,
skilled in the martial arts,

108
00:06:47,830 --> 00:06:49,680
steeped in poetry and propriety,

109
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:51,240
and observant of the Six Rites.

110
00:06:51,240 --> 00:06:52,720
We therefore humbly seek
the good offices of a matchmaker,

111
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:53,320
in the hope

112
00:06:53,510 --> 00:06:55,440
that you will consent to this union

113
00:06:55,630 --> 00:06:57,870
and let our two families be joined as one.

114
00:06:57,870 --> 00:07:00,750
Congratulations, Fourth Lady Xie Qingyuan.

115
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:07,560
Old Madam,

116
00:07:08,190 --> 00:07:09,070
Lord Xie,

117
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:11,750
the Heir put a great deal of thought

118
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:13,920
into the betrothal gifts
for Fourth Lady Xie.

119
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:15,240
And this pair of wild geese

120
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:16,630
was hunted by the Heir

121
00:07:16,680 --> 00:07:17,750
himself.

122
00:07:25,830 --> 00:07:29,600
Please accept the betrothal gifts,
Fourth Lady Xie.

123
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:34,040
Please accept the betrothal gifts,
Fourth Lady Xie.

124
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:37,180
Once you and I are married,

125
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:39,600
you'll be the Young Madam of
the Marquis of Danyang household.

126
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:40,930
And since that murderer

127
00:07:41,360 --> 00:07:43,360
killed the relative of an official,

128
00:07:43,510 --> 00:07:45,110
he should be beheaded for it.

129
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:49,120
It was agreed that he would marry me.

130
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:51,510
How did it suddenly become Xie Qingyuan
without so much as a word?

131
00:07:51,510 --> 00:07:53,390
When on earth will Mother be let out?

132
00:07:53,390 --> 00:07:54,240
Second Sister,

133
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:55,480
Mother is still confined to quarters.

134
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:56,310
If you go now,

135
00:07:56,310 --> 00:07:59,570
you'll only make Grandmother
and Father more displeased.

136
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:01,560
Out of my way.

137
00:08:01,560 --> 00:08:02,820
I want to see my mother.

138
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:04,000
Second Lady,

139
00:08:04,720 --> 00:08:05,800
Master has ordered that

140
00:08:05,800 --> 00:08:06,950
during Madam's recuperation,

141
00:08:06,950 --> 00:08:08,210
no visits are allowed.

142
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:12,050
Get out of my way!

143
00:08:12,430 --> 00:08:14,040
I'm only carrying out Master's orders.

144
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:15,430
Second Lady, you're making such a fuss.

145
00:08:15,430 --> 00:08:17,360
Are you trying to embarrass Madam?

146
00:08:23,390 --> 00:08:25,870
Second Lady, you behave
with such disregard for propriety—

147
00:08:25,870 --> 00:08:27,670
did Madam Hu raise you like this?

148
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:28,270
You...

149
00:08:28,270 --> 00:08:29,200
What did you say?

150
00:08:32,240 --> 00:08:32,789
My Lady!

151
00:08:33,630 --> 00:08:35,030
She's the principal wife's daughter.

152
00:08:35,030 --> 00:08:37,490
Do you know the consequences
if you hurt her?

153
00:08:37,630 --> 00:08:39,390
My mother and father have always
been devoted to each other.

154
00:08:39,390 --> 00:08:41,120
She's merely been confined to her quarters
for a few days.

155
00:08:41,120 --> 00:08:43,840
And you, a lowly servant,
dare to walk all over me?

156
00:08:43,840 --> 00:08:45,720
How dare I hurt you, My Lady?

157
00:08:45,870 --> 00:08:46,910
But if you

158
00:08:46,910 --> 00:08:48,570
insist on acting recklessly,

159
00:08:48,630 --> 00:08:51,120
I have no choice but to
invoke the family rules.

160
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:52,200
Family rules?

161
00:08:53,870 --> 00:08:55,750
She even dares to mention family rules!

162
00:08:55,750 --> 00:08:56,360
Fine!

163
00:08:56,790 --> 00:08:58,310
I'll go fetch Grandmother right now

164
00:08:58,310 --> 00:08:59,310
and let her decide

165
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:01,600
who should be punished
under the family rules.

166
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:02,390
Get lost!

167
00:09:08,720 --> 00:09:09,520
Grandmother,

168
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:11,550
I just wanted to see my mother,

169
00:09:11,870 --> 00:09:13,360
but this wretched maid, Yuejian,

170
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:15,080
actually threatened me with the family rules
and even cursed at me!

171
00:09:15,080 --> 00:09:17,810
She truly has no regard
for her mistress anymore!

172
00:09:18,910 --> 00:09:19,670
Grandmother,

173
00:09:19,670 --> 00:09:21,530
you have to make this right for me.

174
00:09:26,670 --> 00:09:27,390
Yuejian.

175
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:30,720
Come here and sit.

176
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:38,520
Grandmother.

177
00:09:40,840 --> 00:09:41,510
Sit.

178
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:55,510
Yuejian is now

179
00:09:56,200 --> 00:09:58,000
your Sixth Madam.

180
00:09:58,270 --> 00:09:59,790
She is your elder now.

181
00:10:00,240 --> 00:10:01,040
Not to mention

182
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:03,580
she's acting on the patriarch's orders—

183
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:05,240
even if she herself

184
00:10:05,480 --> 00:10:07,110
wanted to discipline you,

185
00:10:07,390 --> 00:10:09,650
she would still have every right to do so.

186
00:10:10,720 --> 00:10:12,080
Sixth Madam?

187
00:10:14,550 --> 00:10:17,680
You actually took advantage of
my mother's confinement

188
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:19,220
to seduce my father!

189
00:10:19,270 --> 00:10:20,200
Insolent!

190
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:22,880
Grandmother,

191
00:10:23,670 --> 00:10:25,840
Second Sister only spoke
without thinking because she

192
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:27,370
was in a moment of distress.

193
00:10:27,440 --> 00:10:29,440
Mothers and daughters share a deep bond.

194
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:30,630
Grandmother, I believe you

195
00:10:30,630 --> 00:10:32,550
wouldn't want such a trivial matter

196
00:10:32,550 --> 00:10:34,680
to disturb the peace of the household.

197
00:10:34,720 --> 00:10:35,360
Why not

198
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:37,130
fulfill my sisters' wishes

199
00:10:37,200 --> 00:10:38,720
and let them visit Mother?

200
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:40,840
That way, there won't be

201
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:43,730
constant commotion
in front of Wuzhu Courtyard.

202
00:10:46,200 --> 00:10:47,000
Fine.

203
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:49,090
Let your mother see for herself

204
00:10:49,600 --> 00:10:50,630
what

205
00:10:51,480 --> 00:10:53,720
you have done these past days.

206
00:10:58,270 --> 00:11:00,510
Spare me your false kindness.

207
00:11:00,960 --> 00:11:03,030
The Marquis of Danyang household
came to offer you betrothal gifts—

208
00:11:03,030 --> 00:11:04,830
what tricks did you play in this?

209
00:11:06,600 --> 00:11:08,360
Don't celebrate just yet.

210
00:11:08,870 --> 00:11:10,390
Whatever is mine,

211
00:11:11,270 --> 00:11:12,600
you can never take away.

212
00:11:17,630 --> 00:11:18,430
Grandmother.

213
00:11:27,240 --> 00:11:28,390
Look at her.

214
00:11:29,320 --> 00:11:31,750
See how her mother has spoiled her.

215
00:11:35,910 --> 00:11:37,480
Listen up, all of you.

216
00:11:37,720 --> 00:11:39,720
Although this is a large household,

217
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:40,870
it has no room

218
00:11:41,480 --> 00:11:44,840
for servants who outwardly comply
while secretly defying orders.

219
00:11:44,840 --> 00:11:46,240
If anyone

220
00:11:46,550 --> 00:11:48,510
relies on their seniority

221
00:11:48,910 --> 00:11:50,480
to throw their weight around

222
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:52,600
and make things difficult for Sixth Madam,

223
00:11:52,600 --> 00:11:53,870
don't blame me

224
00:11:54,600 --> 00:11:55,870
for showing no mercy.

225
00:11:56,600 --> 00:11:58,030
Yes, Old Madam.

226
00:12:00,270 --> 00:12:01,150
Yuejian.

227
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:03,360
Take them away.

228
00:12:19,080 --> 00:12:20,120
Qingyuan.

229
00:12:21,750 --> 00:12:22,810
Come sit beside me.

230
00:12:29,670 --> 00:12:31,240
Have you heard people say

231
00:12:32,360 --> 00:12:34,910
that a woman may never leave
the inner household,

232
00:12:34,910 --> 00:12:39,030
yet she can still hold the fate
of the entire family in her hands?

233
00:12:39,720 --> 00:12:40,790
On a small scale,

234
00:12:41,720 --> 00:12:44,440
it means managing the household well

235
00:12:44,910 --> 00:12:47,110
and handling relationships properly.

236
00:12:47,150 --> 00:12:48,320
On a grand scale,

237
00:12:49,270 --> 00:12:51,030
we too

238
00:12:51,270 --> 00:12:52,550
have a part to play in

239
00:12:53,120 --> 00:12:54,440
who rises to power

240
00:12:55,480 --> 00:12:58,080
and who falls from favor
at the imperial court.

241
00:13:03,670 --> 00:13:04,670
Now that you

242
00:13:05,270 --> 00:13:06,240
have secured

243
00:13:06,240 --> 00:13:08,200
such a fine marriage match,

244
00:13:08,670 --> 00:13:10,910
this isn't only your own good fortune

245
00:13:12,080 --> 00:13:14,480
but also our family's.

246
00:13:16,670 --> 00:13:17,790
You do

247
00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:19,480
have quite a knack

248
00:13:20,150 --> 00:13:21,910
for managing money

249
00:13:22,390 --> 00:13:23,270
and quite a way

250
00:13:23,630 --> 00:13:25,120
with people too.

251
00:13:25,790 --> 00:13:26,720
However,

252
00:13:27,840 --> 00:13:29,200
official rank,

253
00:13:29,630 --> 00:13:30,480
status,

254
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:32,240
and family wealth—

255
00:13:33,320 --> 00:13:34,910
none of these last forever.

256
00:13:35,240 --> 00:13:36,700
One day, without warning,

257
00:13:37,200 --> 00:13:38,550
they can all

258
00:13:39,320 --> 00:13:40,550
be taken from you.

259
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:46,000
Only blood ties

260
00:13:47,480 --> 00:13:49,720
endure.

261
00:13:50,360 --> 00:13:52,670
After you marry into
the Marquis of Danyang household,

262
00:13:52,670 --> 00:13:53,670
don't forget

263
00:13:54,150 --> 00:13:56,440
that you're still a member
of the Xie family.

264
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:58,630
You must speak well of us

265
00:13:59,200 --> 00:14:01,440
and protect our interests.

266
00:14:02,510 --> 00:14:03,390
As for

267
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:06,670
the grievances of the past...

268
00:14:09,790 --> 00:14:10,480
you

269
00:14:11,320 --> 00:14:12,790
should let them go.

270
00:14:16,480 --> 00:14:17,960
I often think of

271
00:14:18,550 --> 00:14:20,880
the kindness you and Father have shown me.

272
00:14:21,320 --> 00:14:22,870
No matter where I am,

273
00:14:23,480 --> 00:14:26,480
I'll certainly put
the Xie family's interests first.

274
00:14:34,600 --> 00:14:35,440
My Lady,

275
00:14:35,550 --> 00:14:37,120
you've been gazing into space
for so long now.

276
00:14:37,120 --> 00:14:38,720
What are you thinking about?

277
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:44,030
I know full well that I've only
risen in Grandmother's estimation

278
00:14:44,030 --> 00:14:46,490
because of my engagement
to Young Master Li.

279
00:14:47,390 --> 00:14:48,440
In all my life,

280
00:14:49,030 --> 00:14:50,430
other than my own mother,

281
00:14:50,840 --> 00:14:52,270
I've never once been

282
00:14:52,550 --> 00:14:55,270
this close to a blood relative before.

283
00:14:56,440 --> 00:14:57,360
I was wondering

284
00:14:58,550 --> 00:15:01,030
what it's like for those girls
who are loved by their parents

285
00:15:01,030 --> 00:15:01,840
in the days

286
00:15:02,440 --> 00:15:04,030
before they marry out.

287
00:15:32,360 --> 00:15:33,120
My Lord,

288
00:15:33,840 --> 00:15:36,720
Fourth Lady Xie really is engaged
to the Heir of the Marquis of Danyang.

289
00:15:36,720 --> 00:15:38,320
I just heard that the betrothal gifts
have been delivered.

290
00:15:38,320 --> 00:15:41,390
The wild geese and marriage contract
have been sent to the Xie Residence.

291
00:15:41,390 --> 00:15:43,390
I hear the Heir's feelings run deep.

292
00:15:43,670 --> 00:15:45,070
He even personally urged

293
00:15:45,080 --> 00:15:49,680
the Marchioness of Danyang to have
the marriage contract prepared without delay.

294
00:15:52,790 --> 00:15:54,050
Whether you're Yan Rui

295
00:15:55,030 --> 00:15:56,030
or Shen Run,

296
00:15:57,000 --> 00:15:58,730
since our paths are different,

297
00:16:00,670 --> 00:16:01,870
let's part ways here.

298
00:16:40,670 --> 00:16:41,440
Sir.

299
00:16:42,440 --> 00:16:43,270
Do you sell

300
00:16:43,360 --> 00:16:44,790
yellow paper here?

301
00:16:45,750 --> 00:16:46,790
Third Lady Xie?

302
00:16:51,240 --> 00:16:53,270
How do you know me, sir?

303
00:16:53,750 --> 00:16:54,670
I am Zhou Peian,

304
00:16:55,000 --> 00:16:56,910
a fellow disciple and senior classmate
of Pei Lanshan.

305
00:16:56,910 --> 00:16:58,150
I once caught a glimpse of you

306
00:16:58,150 --> 00:17:00,280
at the Spring Banquet, Third Lady Xie.

307
00:17:01,630 --> 00:17:02,960
So, you're Senior Zhou.

308
00:17:06,069 --> 00:17:07,589
We don't have

309
00:17:07,640 --> 00:17:09,310
the yellow paper you're looking for here.

310
00:17:09,310 --> 00:17:10,550
However, it's not hard to find.

311
00:17:10,550 --> 00:17:11,609
I'll keep an eye out

312
00:17:11,829 --> 00:17:14,270
and have it delivered
to your residence later.

313
00:17:14,270 --> 00:17:15,930
Then, thank you, Senior Zhou.

314
00:17:18,160 --> 00:17:18,750
Goodbye.

315
00:17:19,480 --> 00:17:20,339
Third Lady Xie.

316
00:17:22,349 --> 00:17:24,410
What's this scripture in your hands?

317
00:17:27,310 --> 00:17:28,770
This is the Rebirth Sutra,

318
00:17:29,070 --> 00:17:30,950
used to pray for my late mother.

319
00:17:38,270 --> 00:17:39,730
This isn't my place to say,

320
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:40,880
but

321
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:43,070
there is no room for error
in matters concerning the dead.

322
00:17:43,070 --> 00:17:44,920
The scripture in your hands is actually

323
00:17:44,920 --> 00:17:47,510
the Soul-Suppressing Mantra,
used to suppress vengeful spirits.

324
00:17:47,510 --> 00:17:50,160
It's an exceedingly rare scripture.

325
00:18:00,680 --> 00:18:01,550
Fourth Sister!

326
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:03,540
Fourth Sister!

327
00:18:06,960 --> 00:18:07,820
Fourth Sister!

328
00:18:21,200 --> 00:18:22,530
Last time, you warned me

329
00:18:23,400 --> 00:18:24,860
that my own mother's death

330
00:18:24,960 --> 00:18:26,960
was not solely Mei Yinghua's doing.

331
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:28,260
Do you know something?

332
00:18:38,310 --> 00:18:39,070
To be honest,

333
00:18:39,590 --> 00:18:40,920
I don't want anyone else

334
00:18:41,440 --> 00:18:42,830
dragged into this.

335
00:18:44,240 --> 00:18:45,460
But if there truly is

336
00:18:45,830 --> 00:18:47,000
more to it,

337
00:18:47,240 --> 00:18:48,720
then whoever was responsible

338
00:18:48,720 --> 00:18:51,000
has been hiding
in the household for 19 years.

339
00:18:51,000 --> 00:18:52,480
That's frightening enough that we can't

340
00:18:52,480 --> 00:18:54,080
afford to let our guard down.

341
00:18:58,880 --> 00:19:01,280
Mei Yinghua knows nothing about medicine.

342
00:19:01,350 --> 00:19:04,590
In this entire household, the person
most knowledgeable about medicine

343
00:19:04,590 --> 00:19:05,680
is Concubine Lian.

344
00:19:06,350 --> 00:19:07,720
And on the day my own mother died,

345
00:19:07,720 --> 00:19:09,920
she was the only one nowhere to be found.

346
00:19:10,680 --> 00:19:13,030
Could she be involved in this?

347
00:19:15,310 --> 00:19:17,830
Concubine Lian did tell Concubine Mei

348
00:19:17,830 --> 00:19:19,480
about the toxicity of the euphorbia.

349
00:19:19,480 --> 00:19:22,880
But she's kept to herself,
rarely going out for over a decade,

350
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:25,830
and she can't even decide
her own daughter's marriage.

351
00:19:25,830 --> 00:19:27,490
With a temperament like hers,

352
00:19:27,510 --> 00:19:28,720
how could she possibly

353
00:19:28,720 --> 00:19:30,450
have done such a vicious thing?

354
00:19:38,830 --> 00:19:40,790
Those who witnessed it firsthand back then

355
00:19:40,790 --> 00:19:41,750
are either dead

356
00:19:42,550 --> 00:19:43,480
or long gone.

357
00:19:44,550 --> 00:19:45,750
Of those who remain,

358
00:19:46,220 --> 00:19:48,020
Concubine Lian dares not speak,

359
00:19:48,590 --> 00:19:50,880
and Grandmother would rather
let the matter rest

360
00:19:50,880 --> 00:19:52,000
than tell you.

361
00:19:52,350 --> 00:19:54,010
Of everyone, Mother is the one

362
00:19:56,750 --> 00:19:57,880
who should tell you.

363
00:20:00,310 --> 00:20:02,110
Even if she doesn't know the full truth,

364
00:20:02,110 --> 00:20:04,970
she shouldn't be
stopping you from looking into it.

365
00:20:05,550 --> 00:20:06,510
You're

366
00:20:08,070 --> 00:20:08,930
suspecting...

367
00:20:13,070 --> 00:20:13,920
Third Sister,

368
00:20:16,030 --> 00:20:17,240
can you still recall

369
00:20:17,240 --> 00:20:18,770
the details from back then?

370
00:20:19,030 --> 00:20:19,680
Who

371
00:20:20,000 --> 00:20:21,460
went to Luoying Pavilion?

372
00:20:21,830 --> 00:20:22,550
Who

373
00:20:23,110 --> 00:20:25,240
was the first to find your mother dead?

374
00:20:35,400 --> 00:20:36,110
I remember.

375
00:20:38,920 --> 00:20:40,580
Back then, apart from Cui'er,

376
00:20:41,440 --> 00:20:43,480
only Grandmother and Mother came.

377
00:20:44,680 --> 00:20:46,790
Then they covered her with a white cloth

378
00:20:46,790 --> 00:20:47,990
and carried her away.

379
00:20:50,350 --> 00:20:53,480
Do you still remember
what your mother looked like then?

380
00:20:54,070 --> 00:20:54,880
At that time,

381
00:20:55,550 --> 00:20:57,210
I saw that her face was bluish,

382
00:20:57,480 --> 00:20:58,880
and her lips were purple.

383
00:20:58,960 --> 00:20:59,890
What did you say?

384
00:21:01,920 --> 00:21:04,250
Your mother didn't die from a hemorrhage?

385
00:21:04,400 --> 00:21:05,240
A hemorrhage?

386
00:21:08,830 --> 00:21:09,590
No.

387
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:10,550
I...

388
00:21:11,350 --> 00:21:12,640
Even though I was still young then,

389
00:21:12,640 --> 00:21:13,780
I remember clearly.

390
00:21:14,960 --> 00:21:16,560
There was no heavy bleeding.

391
00:21:20,160 --> 00:21:21,820
Poisoning from the euphorbia

392
00:21:22,160 --> 00:21:24,110
causes miscarriage
with severe hemorrhaging.

393
00:21:24,110 --> 00:21:25,980
If the face is deathly pale

394
00:21:26,310 --> 00:21:27,480
and bluish,

395
00:21:28,160 --> 00:21:29,340
with purple lips,

396
00:21:30,270 --> 00:21:31,240
it indicates...

397
00:21:38,790 --> 00:21:40,000
suffocation.

398
00:21:46,250 --> 00:21:48,810
[Danyue Pavilion]

399
00:21:54,720 --> 00:21:55,640
My Lady!

400
00:21:55,750 --> 00:21:58,440
Old Madam has gone to Hanxiang Parlor
with Yuejian.

401
00:21:58,440 --> 00:21:59,250
They said

402
00:21:59,440 --> 00:22:02,500
they'll marry Eldest Lady off
to the Hu family tonight.

403
00:22:06,960 --> 00:22:08,150
Enough,

404
00:22:09,000 --> 00:22:09,870
Fanqiao.

405
00:22:10,640 --> 00:22:12,720
Stop crying.

406
00:22:13,830 --> 00:22:16,550
Commissioner Hu is a man of great status.

407
00:22:16,790 --> 00:22:18,850
It wouldn't be an exaggeration to say

408
00:22:18,880 --> 00:22:20,680
he's at the pinnacle of officialdom.

409
00:22:20,680 --> 00:22:23,210
The fact that he's taken a liking
to our Qinghe

410
00:22:23,590 --> 00:22:25,960
is her good fortune.

411
00:22:28,160 --> 00:22:29,220
Old Madam,

412
00:22:29,510 --> 00:22:30,400
you suddenly announced

413
00:22:30,400 --> 00:22:31,960
that she'll be married off today.

414
00:22:31,960 --> 00:22:33,890
We haven't prepared anything yet.

415
00:22:34,110 --> 00:22:35,790
Isn't this rather rushed?

416
00:22:36,240 --> 00:22:38,970
I beg you to discuss it further
with the patriarch

417
00:22:39,000 --> 00:22:40,350
and delay it a few days.

418
00:22:46,680 --> 00:22:47,920
This marriage

419
00:22:48,440 --> 00:22:50,160
was decided long ago.

420
00:22:50,790 --> 00:22:53,070
The betrothal gifts
have also been delivered.

421
00:22:53,070 --> 00:22:53,790
Look,

422
00:22:54,350 --> 00:22:57,720
the wedding robe you sewed yourself
for our Qinghe

423
00:22:58,000 --> 00:22:59,130
fits her perfectly,

424
00:22:59,400 --> 00:23:01,510
and now it's finally being put to use.

425
00:23:03,160 --> 00:23:04,270
Qinghe

426
00:23:04,750 --> 00:23:05,880
is going to marry him

427
00:23:06,920 --> 00:23:08,640
as a concubine,

428
00:23:09,030 --> 00:23:11,640
not as a properly wedded principal wife.

429
00:23:12,110 --> 00:23:14,240
There's no need for much preparation.

430
00:23:15,440 --> 00:23:16,270
Right now,

431
00:23:16,880 --> 00:23:19,480
the Hu family's bridal sedan chair
is waiting.

432
00:23:19,960 --> 00:23:22,760
How can you expect me
to go back on the marriage now?

433
00:23:23,160 --> 00:23:24,270
Not only would that

434
00:23:24,640 --> 00:23:26,040
humiliate the Hu family,

435
00:23:26,240 --> 00:23:28,100
but it would also leave our family

436
00:23:28,830 --> 00:23:30,560
with no way to hold our heads up.

437
00:23:32,680 --> 00:23:33,550
Grandmother,

438
00:23:34,350 --> 00:23:36,350
the Pei family
has already come to clarify that

439
00:23:36,350 --> 00:23:40,480
the engagement was broken off because
Madam Pei's mourning period is not yet over.

440
00:23:40,480 --> 00:23:42,740
Young Master Pei and I are deeply in love.

441
00:23:43,960 --> 00:23:45,000
I hope you

442
00:23:45,640 --> 00:23:47,270
can give me a few more days.

443
00:23:47,960 --> 00:23:49,000
Old Madam!

444
00:23:53,920 --> 00:23:55,030
The Pei family

445
00:23:56,310 --> 00:23:58,110
has already shown your father

446
00:23:58,530 --> 00:24:00,110
more than enough courtesy

447
00:24:00,960 --> 00:24:02,960
by not spelling things out plainly.

448
00:24:03,070 --> 00:24:04,640
You should know better

449
00:24:04,880 --> 00:24:06,510
and give up on this.

450
00:24:06,960 --> 00:24:08,960
You're 5 years older than Qingyuan.

451
00:24:09,510 --> 00:24:10,200
Now,

452
00:24:10,480 --> 00:24:13,340
she is about to marry into
the Marquis's household.

453
00:24:13,440 --> 00:24:16,570
Yet, your engagement with the Pei family
was broken off.

454
00:24:17,240 --> 00:24:19,270
If we don't do something,

455
00:24:19,790 --> 00:24:20,750
others

456
00:24:21,510 --> 00:24:23,920
will laugh at our family.

457
00:24:26,480 --> 00:24:27,440
Enough.

458
00:24:28,400 --> 00:24:30,270
This is the decision the patriarch and I

459
00:24:30,270 --> 00:24:31,480
have made together.

460
00:24:33,240 --> 00:24:35,040
There's no room for discussion.

461
00:24:40,590 --> 00:24:41,440
Old Madam?

462
00:24:44,240 --> 00:24:45,030
Old Madam!

463
00:24:46,000 --> 00:24:46,920
Old Madam!

464
00:25:12,920 --> 00:25:15,110
I've endured everything without complaint

465
00:25:15,110 --> 00:25:16,270
for 20 years.

466
00:25:25,200 --> 00:25:27,070
All because I hoped you would find

467
00:25:28,270 --> 00:25:30,730
a husband
who truly loved and cherished you,

468
00:25:32,110 --> 00:25:34,160
so you could escape this misery.

469
00:25:35,310 --> 00:25:37,160
Not to be a gift for the Xie family

470
00:25:38,240 --> 00:25:40,550
to curry favor with the powerful.

471
00:25:47,000 --> 00:25:48,000
But...

472
00:25:50,640 --> 00:25:52,440
I have no way to stop this either.

473
00:25:59,350 --> 00:26:00,110
Third Madam.

474
00:26:01,310 --> 00:26:02,240
Eldest Sister.

475
00:26:08,030 --> 00:26:10,030
I have a plan to break this deadlock.

476
00:26:11,510 --> 00:26:13,570
I wonder if you'd be willing to try it.

477
00:26:22,550 --> 00:26:23,680
Old Madam!

478
00:26:25,270 --> 00:26:26,030
Old Madam!

479
00:26:26,160 --> 00:26:27,020
Eldest Lady...

480
00:26:27,110 --> 00:26:27,970
Eldest Lady...

481
00:26:28,030 --> 00:26:28,920
Calm down.

482
00:26:29,030 --> 00:26:30,310
What happened to Eldest Lady?

483
00:26:30,310 --> 00:26:31,830
Eldest Lady is missing!

484
00:26:33,200 --> 00:26:34,310
What?

485
00:26:36,140 --> 00:26:38,200
-Search thoroughly!
-Eldest Lady!

486
00:26:38,200 --> 00:26:39,730
Where're you, Eldest Lady?

487
00:26:41,080 --> 00:26:42,280
-Eldest Lady!
-Eldest Lady!

488
00:26:42,280 --> 00:26:44,440
-Eldest Lady!
-Eldest Lady!

489
00:26:44,790 --> 00:26:46,190
-Eldest Lady!
-Eldest Lady!

490
00:26:46,190 --> 00:26:46,890
Eldest Lady!

491
00:26:46,890 --> 00:26:48,800
-Eldest Lady!
-Eldest Lady!

492
00:26:49,160 --> 00:26:49,880
She's not here.

493
00:26:49,880 --> 00:26:51,240
-Eldest Lady!
-Eldest Lady!

494
00:26:51,240 --> 00:26:52,960
Search every corner!

495
00:26:52,960 --> 00:26:54,080
-Eldest Lady!
-Eldest Lady!

496
00:26:54,080 --> 00:26:55,680
-Eldest Lady!
-Eldest Lady!

497
00:26:56,310 --> 00:26:57,040
Eldest Lady!

498
00:26:57,060 --> 00:26:57,790
-Master.
-Eldest Lady!

499
00:26:57,790 --> 00:26:58,960
-We still haven't found her.
-Eldest Lady!

500
00:26:58,960 --> 00:27:00,110
-Master.
-Eldest Lady!

501
00:27:00,110 --> 00:27:02,290
-Someone saw her flee toward the South Gate.
-Eldest Lady!

502
00:27:02,290 --> 00:27:03,720
-Go after her.
-Where are you?

503
00:27:03,720 --> 00:27:05,030
Head for the South Gate!

504
00:27:05,030 --> 00:27:05,960
She's at the South Gate!

505
00:27:05,960 --> 00:27:06,550
After her!

506
00:27:06,550 --> 00:27:07,720
Let's go. To the South Gate.

507
00:27:07,720 --> 00:27:09,240
Eldest Lady, where are you?

508
00:27:09,240 --> 00:27:10,650
-Eldest Lady!
-Eldest Lady!

509
00:27:10,650 --> 00:27:12,250
-Eldest Lady!
-Eldest Lady!

510
00:27:13,680 --> 00:27:14,720
Eldest Lady!

511
00:27:15,780 --> 00:27:16,840
Eldest Lady, where are you?

512
00:27:16,840 --> 00:27:18,470
Eldest Lady, where are you?

513
00:27:19,110 --> 00:27:20,270
Eldest Lady!

514
00:27:20,400 --> 00:27:21,920
[Qiyun Alley]

515
00:27:26,270 --> 00:27:26,830
My Lord,

516
00:27:27,510 --> 00:27:28,270
you see, right now,

517
00:27:28,270 --> 00:27:30,270
we've been catching
those small-fry officials.

518
00:27:30,270 --> 00:27:32,330
When are we going after a bigger fish?

519
00:27:32,510 --> 00:27:33,480
Don't rush.

520
00:27:34,440 --> 00:27:36,640
Once the small fry in the river are gone,

521
00:27:36,880 --> 00:27:38,590
even the most patient big fish

522
00:27:38,830 --> 00:27:40,030
will bite the bait

523
00:27:40,510 --> 00:27:41,510
when its food runs out.

524
00:27:41,510 --> 00:27:43,750
Eldest Lady, stop right there!

525
00:27:44,750 --> 00:27:45,880
-Cheers.
-Stop!

526
00:27:47,560 --> 00:27:48,600
Catch her!

527
00:27:50,400 --> 00:27:51,380
Go take a look.

528
00:27:51,550 --> 00:27:52,810
Eldest Lady!

529
00:27:52,960 --> 00:27:55,650
You can't elope, Eldest Lady!

530
00:27:55,670 --> 00:27:57,520
Eldest Lady, stop!

531
00:27:58,200 --> 00:27:59,270
Eldest Lady!

532
00:27:59,550 --> 00:28:00,350
Don't run!

533
00:28:00,510 --> 00:28:02,070
Hurry up. Eldest Lady!

534
00:28:02,070 --> 00:28:02,920
-She's over there!
-Stop!

535
00:28:02,920 --> 00:28:04,480
-Stop!
-Don't run!

536
00:28:06,790 --> 00:28:07,390
What is it?

537
00:28:08,240 --> 00:28:09,100
Nothing major.

538
00:28:09,240 --> 00:28:11,310
-The Xie family seems to be looking for...
-Stop!

539
00:28:11,310 --> 00:28:12,880
-their Eldest Lady who ran away.
-Eldest Lady!

540
00:28:12,880 --> 00:28:13,750
Don't run!

541
00:28:14,000 --> 00:28:15,150
Eldest Lady Xie?

542
00:28:15,240 --> 00:28:17,440
-Why is she running away?
-Eldest Lady!

543
00:28:23,510 --> 00:28:24,640
Who cares.

544
00:28:24,830 --> 00:28:25,560
Let's drink.

545
00:28:26,590 --> 00:28:27,050
Come on.

546
00:28:29,000 --> 00:28:29,830
Stop!

547
00:28:30,310 --> 00:28:31,160
Catch her!

548
00:28:31,160 --> 00:28:31,680
Don't run!

549
00:28:31,680 --> 00:28:32,430
Stop!

550
00:28:32,470 --> 00:28:33,030
Hurry up!

551
00:28:33,440 --> 00:28:34,550
-Stop!
-Don't run!

552
00:28:34,550 --> 00:28:35,550
Catch her!

553
00:28:35,750 --> 00:28:36,720
Stop!

554
00:28:37,640 --> 00:28:38,160
Don't run!

555
00:28:38,160 --> 00:28:39,700
-Stop!
-Don't run!

556
00:28:39,750 --> 00:28:40,480
Stop!

557
00:28:43,790 --> 00:28:44,850
What are you doing?

558
00:28:46,770 --> 00:28:48,620
[Guan-guan Go the Ospreys]

559
00:28:51,400 --> 00:28:53,000
Putting on a show, all of you?

560
00:28:53,000 --> 00:28:53,920
Honored lords,

561
00:28:54,440 --> 00:28:55,390
this old servant

562
00:28:55,830 --> 00:28:57,750
is in pursuit of
the Xie family's Eldest Lady,

563
00:28:57,750 --> 00:28:59,240
who has eloped.

564
00:28:59,240 --> 00:29:00,720
I hope you

565
00:29:01,000 --> 00:29:02,460
can show us some leniency.

566
00:29:03,640 --> 00:29:05,240
What are you waiting for? Go!

567
00:29:09,550 --> 00:29:10,550
Commander,

568
00:29:11,000 --> 00:29:14,820
if I can't bring back
the eloping Eldest Lady tonight,

569
00:29:14,880 --> 00:29:17,010
I won't be able to report back!

570
00:29:17,200 --> 00:29:19,860
I hope you can
grant us a small favor, Commander.

571
00:29:20,880 --> 00:29:22,810
What if she's not your Eldest Lady?

572
00:29:33,200 --> 00:29:34,400
Fourth Lady?

573
00:29:34,400 --> 00:29:36,430
She's not Eldest Lady.

574
00:29:36,480 --> 00:29:37,480
Commander, please forgive us.

575
00:29:37,480 --> 00:29:38,940
I got the wrong young lady.

576
00:29:39,160 --> 00:29:40,160
Stop right there!

577
00:29:40,880 --> 00:29:41,550
You come and go

578
00:29:41,550 --> 00:29:42,640
as you please.

579
00:29:42,880 --> 00:29:44,830
Have you no regard for me at all?

580
00:29:47,680 --> 00:29:48,960
Fourth Lady,

581
00:29:49,270 --> 00:29:50,160
Commander,

582
00:29:50,440 --> 00:29:52,070
this old servant's eyes must've failed me!

583
00:29:52,070 --> 00:29:53,930
Please forgive me, Commander.

584
00:29:54,440 --> 00:29:56,100
Commander, please calm down.

585
00:29:56,160 --> 00:29:57,960
She's just a crude maidservant.

586
00:29:58,110 --> 00:29:59,830
I beg you to show her mercy.

587
00:30:01,480 --> 00:30:02,720
Thank you, Fourth Lady.

588
00:30:02,720 --> 00:30:04,050
Thank you, Fourth Lady.

589
00:30:04,640 --> 00:30:06,400
Then, according to the Xie family rules,

590
00:30:06,400 --> 00:30:07,720
slap yourself 30 times—

591
00:30:07,720 --> 00:30:08,580
what do you say?

592
00:30:14,550 --> 00:30:16,080
Hurry up and slap yourself.

593
00:30:19,720 --> 00:30:20,400
One.

594
00:30:20,790 --> 00:30:21,510
Two.

595
00:30:22,240 --> 00:30:22,960
Two.

596
00:30:23,590 --> 00:30:24,200
Two.

597
00:30:24,920 --> 00:30:25,820
Two.

598
00:30:27,160 --> 00:30:28,460
Two.

599
00:30:29,070 --> 00:30:30,110
Three.

600
00:30:30,880 --> 00:30:32,000
Three.

601
00:30:32,310 --> 00:30:33,750
Alright, stop it.

602
00:30:35,720 --> 00:30:37,120
Keep slapping yourself!

603
00:30:39,000 --> 00:30:39,790
Hurry up.

604
00:30:47,400 --> 00:30:49,410
Twenty-nine. Thirty.

605
00:30:50,480 --> 00:30:51,340
Get out of here.

606
00:30:53,200 --> 00:30:54,730
Don't forget your lantern.

607
00:30:57,350 --> 00:30:59,080
Take care. We won't see you out!

608
00:32:23,240 --> 00:32:24,000
Mother,

609
00:32:24,310 --> 00:32:25,550
this wedding robe

610
00:32:26,200 --> 00:32:27,480
is really beautiful.

611
00:32:27,640 --> 00:32:33,330
♪ Waiting for a dream to sink into
the depths of the night ♪

612
00:32:28,880 --> 00:32:30,680
Try it on and let me see.

613
00:32:33,390 --> 00:32:39,460
♪ Waiting for a rain to wash away
the heat burning in my eyes ♪

614
00:32:39,530 --> 00:32:45,200
♪ Waiting for a few flowers to bloom,
then quietly fall ♪

615
00:32:45,220 --> 00:32:51,330
♪ Only then do I understand right
from what's wrong and bitter ♪

616
00:32:51,360 --> 00:32:57,520
♪ Pear blossoms drift through the courtyard,
fluttering like snowflakes in a song ♪

617
00:32:57,580 --> 00:33:03,670
♪ Singing the silence of love and hate ♪

618
00:33:01,830 --> 00:33:02,400
Mother,

619
00:33:02,400 --> 00:33:03,240
am I pretty?

620
00:33:03,700 --> 00:33:10,090
♪  Which moment is hypothetical,
and which is a real choice? ♪

621
00:33:04,830 --> 00:33:06,000
Yes.

622
00:33:07,350 --> 00:33:08,790
My Qinghe

623
00:33:09,240 --> 00:33:10,550
is truly beautiful.

624
00:33:10,150 --> 00:33:16,070
♪ Who is drifting aimlessly in the wind? ♪

625
00:33:16,160 --> 00:33:22,290
♪ I wonder why joy is always
so scarce in this world ♪

626
00:33:17,400 --> 00:33:18,350
You've

627
00:33:18,790 --> 00:33:20,640
always liked sleeping
without enough covers.

628
00:33:20,640 --> 00:33:22,320
Once I'm no longer by your side,

629
00:33:22,320 --> 00:33:28,260
♪ I wonder,
is that tear a loss or a gain? ♪

630
00:33:22,960 --> 00:33:23,680
be sure

631
00:33:24,000 --> 00:33:26,110
to keep yourself well covered
with blankets at night.

632
00:33:26,110 --> 00:33:27,840
Especially when autumn comes,

633
00:33:28,000 --> 00:33:29,590
wear more layers.

634
00:33:28,310 --> 00:33:34,530
♪ Two souls trapped on the opposite banks
of life and death ♪

635
00:33:30,350 --> 00:33:31,950
Don't let yourself get cold.

636
00:33:34,550 --> 00:33:40,550
♪ May you and I overcome karma's bonds ♪

637
00:33:37,400 --> 00:33:39,160
Once you're out there on your own,

638
00:33:39,160 --> 00:33:40,820
it won't be like being at home.

639
00:33:41,350 --> 00:33:42,350
Don't be too picky

640
00:33:42,750 --> 00:33:43,950
about food and drink,

641
00:33:44,960 --> 00:33:47,020
but don't mistreat yourself either.

642
00:33:49,790 --> 00:33:52,920
You must hide the jewelry and valuables

643
00:33:53,200 --> 00:33:54,640
in different places.

644
00:33:55,510 --> 00:33:57,350
If someone steals or robs you,

645
00:33:57,830 --> 00:33:59,560
at least you'll have some left.

646
00:34:00,880 --> 00:34:02,880
If Lanshan ever treats you badly...

647
00:34:07,240 --> 00:34:07,960
Mother,

648
00:34:08,830 --> 00:34:14,659
♪ Waiting for a dream to sink into
the depths of the night ♪

649
00:34:09,030 --> 00:34:10,230
please rest assured.

650
00:34:10,440 --> 00:34:12,570
Whether Lanshan treats me well or not,

651
00:34:12,840 --> 00:34:14,500
I'll take good care of myself.

652
00:34:14,690 --> 00:34:20,590
♪ Waiting for a rain to wash away
the heat burning in my eyes ♪

653
00:34:20,830 --> 00:34:26,179
♪ Waiting for a few flowers to bloom,
then quietly fall ♪

654
00:34:21,320 --> 00:34:22,440
But what about you?

655
00:34:24,150 --> 00:34:25,679
Have you ever thought about

656
00:34:26,270 --> 00:34:32,770
♪ Only then do I understand right
from what's wrong and bitter ♪

657
00:34:26,280 --> 00:34:27,440
what will happen after I...

658
00:34:27,440 --> 00:34:28,360
Eldest Lady!

659
00:34:29,230 --> 00:34:30,190
Eldest Lady,

660
00:34:30,480 --> 00:34:31,440
it's time to go.

661
00:34:32,880 --> 00:34:38,600
♪ Pear blossoms drift through the courtyard,
fluttering like snowflakes in a song ♪

662
00:34:33,630 --> 00:34:34,280
Mother.

663
00:34:37,480 --> 00:34:38,960
I've already figured out where to go.

664
00:34:38,659 --> 00:34:44,760
♪ Singing the silence of love and hate ♪

665
00:34:39,230 --> 00:34:39,800
Go.

666
00:34:39,960 --> 00:34:40,480
Mother.

667
00:34:40,960 --> 00:34:41,590
Let's go.

668
00:34:41,800 --> 00:34:42,960
-Or it'll be too late.
-Go.

669
00:34:42,960 --> 00:34:43,510
Mother.

670
00:34:43,880 --> 00:34:44,440
Go.

671
00:34:44,670 --> 00:34:45,320
Mother!

672
00:34:44,790 --> 00:34:51,179
♪  Which moment is hypothetical,
and which is a real choice? ♪

673
00:34:51,239 --> 00:34:57,550
♪ Who is drifting aimlessly in the wind? ♪

674
00:34:57,580 --> 00:35:03,940
♪ I wonder why joy is always
so scarce in this world ♪

675
00:35:04,050 --> 00:35:09,980
♪ I wonder,
is that tear a loss or a gain? ♪

676
00:35:10,030 --> 00:35:16,260
♪ Two souls trapped on the opposite banks
of life and death ♪

677
00:35:10,440 --> 00:35:12,030
Today, through tears,

678
00:35:12,030 --> 00:35:13,630
I see you off by the riverbank.

679
00:35:13,630 --> 00:35:15,000
The east wind blows for a thousand miles,

680
00:35:15,000 --> 00:35:16,200
like a distant dream.

681
00:35:16,270 --> 00:35:22,270
♪ May you and I overcome karma's bonds ♪

682
00:35:17,000 --> 00:35:19,530
Eldest Sister has finally
escaped this cage,

683
00:35:19,670 --> 00:35:21,030
with a whole world before her.

684
00:35:21,030 --> 00:35:22,360
Now she can live for herself.

685
00:35:22,360 --> 00:35:28,160
♪ The wind blows away old memories,
piling them in heaps before the door ♪

686
00:35:22,480 --> 00:35:23,610
So envious, are you?

687
00:35:24,070 --> 00:35:25,930
If you could let go of your hatred,

688
00:35:26,550 --> 00:35:28,010
you could also leave here.

689
00:35:28,160 --> 00:35:34,180
♪ No one speaks for anyone else ♪

690
00:35:28,190 --> 00:35:29,230
Why envy others?

691
00:35:30,230 --> 00:35:31,280
What about you?

692
00:35:32,230 --> 00:35:33,800
Commander, would you be willing to

693
00:35:33,800 --> 00:35:34,960
return to Anxiang Village with me,

694
00:35:34,290 --> 00:35:40,580
♪ Which page is a missed opportunity,
and which holds my hopes? ♪

695
00:35:35,230 --> 00:35:37,000
to never concern yourself
with worldly affairs again,

696
00:35:37,000 --> 00:35:38,600
and to set aside all grudges?

697
00:35:40,610 --> 00:35:47,060
♪ Forgotten in a lonely corner ♪

698
00:35:47,080 --> 00:35:53,110
♪ Waiting for time
to teach us both how to let go ♪

699
00:35:49,150 --> 00:35:50,110
I can't.

700
00:35:51,070 --> 00:35:52,870
What about you, Fourth Lady Xie?

701
00:35:53,140 --> 00:35:59,500
♪ Waiting for our wounds to heal,
no longer asking why ♪

702
00:35:57,480 --> 00:35:59,080
You already know the answer.

703
00:35:59,520 --> 00:36:05,600
♪ Waiting for us to slowly learn
the shapes of love and hate in this life ♪

704
00:35:59,550 --> 00:36:00,960
People like us,

705
00:36:01,670 --> 00:36:03,320
with hearts full of hatred

706
00:36:03,710 --> 00:36:04,480
and schemes,

707
00:36:05,000 --> 00:36:06,550
can never find peace.

708
00:36:05,620 --> 00:36:11,990
♪ Waiting for one final goodbye,
then letting go ♪

709
00:36:14,030 --> 00:36:15,030
Regardless,

710
00:36:15,210 --> 00:36:23,760
♪ No more wandering and worrying ♪

711
00:36:15,360 --> 00:36:16,550
thank you,

712
00:36:16,710 --> 00:36:18,590
Lord Shen, for helping me out tonight.

713
00:36:18,590 --> 00:36:19,920
You don't owe me anything.

714
00:36:19,920 --> 00:36:20,980
No need to thank me.

715
00:36:21,550 --> 00:36:24,150
I'm thanking you
on behalf of my eldest sister.

716
00:36:25,070 --> 00:36:26,280
May she

717
00:36:26,550 --> 00:36:27,840
be safe and well,

718
00:36:28,320 --> 00:36:29,850
free of hatred and grudges.

719
00:36:41,480 --> 00:36:43,680
A mere servant of yours went out to catch

720
00:36:43,760 --> 00:36:46,550
your daughter in an illicit affair,
and actually dragged me into it.

721
00:36:46,550 --> 00:36:48,800
My Lord, you truly
ought to think carefully

722
00:36:48,800 --> 00:36:50,730
about what explanation you owe me.

723
00:36:51,800 --> 00:36:53,360
In a single night,

724
00:36:54,960 --> 00:36:57,000
my most obedient eldest daughter

725
00:36:57,000 --> 00:36:58,320
eloped with a man.

726
00:36:58,550 --> 00:37:00,750
And my most beloved youngest daughter,

727
00:37:01,510 --> 00:37:02,840
who is already engaged,

728
00:37:03,030 --> 00:37:06,030
was caught meeting another man
in secret late at night

729
00:37:06,110 --> 00:37:07,800
and disturbed the Commander.

730
00:37:08,480 --> 00:37:09,320
Great.

731
00:37:10,760 --> 00:37:12,800
Just great, all of you.

732
00:37:13,800 --> 00:37:15,880
This was entirely my doing.

733
00:37:16,480 --> 00:37:18,030
It has nothing to do with Qingyuan.

734
00:37:18,030 --> 00:37:20,160
She couldn't bear to see her own sister

735
00:37:20,670 --> 00:37:22,930
forced to marry an old man as a concubine.

736
00:37:23,630 --> 00:37:25,000
What did she do wrong?

737
00:37:29,710 --> 00:37:30,840
Concubine Lian,

738
00:37:31,800 --> 00:37:34,730
I always thought
you were gentle and well-mannered.

739
00:37:34,880 --> 00:37:36,190
And I believed

740
00:37:36,510 --> 00:37:38,510
I'd treated your branch fairly.

741
00:37:39,550 --> 00:37:41,480
Do you realize that because of you,

742
00:37:41,800 --> 00:37:43,600
the reputation of the Xie family

743
00:37:43,880 --> 00:37:45,670
has been ruined

744
00:37:46,360 --> 00:37:47,590
overnight?

745
00:37:53,030 --> 00:37:54,830
Do you realize your wrongdoing?

746
00:37:55,030 --> 00:37:57,320
The reputation and face

747
00:37:57,920 --> 00:37:59,230
of the Xie family again.

748
00:37:59,230 --> 00:38:01,880
You haven't grown tired of

749
00:38:02,800 --> 00:38:05,730
saying these high-sounding things
all these years,

750
00:38:06,000 --> 00:38:07,600
but I'm sick of hearing them.

751
00:38:10,000 --> 00:38:11,070
Xie Shu!

752
00:38:12,030 --> 00:38:13,480
You keep claiming

753
00:38:14,110 --> 00:38:16,570
that everything you do
is for the Xie family.

754
00:38:16,760 --> 00:38:17,820
Then let me ask you—

755
00:38:19,190 --> 00:38:20,630
you used your son's death

756
00:38:21,070 --> 00:38:22,690
to claim credit and gain a title,

757
00:38:22,690 --> 00:38:23,960
and then you forced your daughter

758
00:38:23,960 --> 00:38:25,480
to marry a 60-year-old man

759
00:38:26,070 --> 00:38:29,670
from the Hu family—the very family
responsible for your son's death!

760
00:38:29,670 --> 00:38:30,880
In your heart,

761
00:38:31,440 --> 00:38:33,150
does this so-called Xie family

762
00:38:33,150 --> 00:38:34,030
include them?

763
00:38:34,190 --> 00:38:35,250
Does it include me?

764
00:38:35,320 --> 00:38:36,850
Or is it only ever about you?

765
00:38:47,110 --> 00:38:47,710
Servants,

766
00:38:48,800 --> 00:38:50,590
punish her according to the family rules.

767
00:38:50,590 --> 00:38:51,850
Right here in the hall.

768
00:38:52,320 --> 00:38:53,780
Fifty strokes of the cane!

769
00:38:54,030 --> 00:38:54,760
Yes, Master.

770
00:38:56,960 --> 00:38:57,960
No, Father.

771
00:38:58,400 --> 00:39:00,360
You'd better keep out of this!

772
00:39:01,030 --> 00:39:01,670
Father,

773
00:39:02,230 --> 00:39:04,360
my own mother and Fifth Madam are dead.

774
00:39:04,480 --> 00:39:06,680
Mother is confined in Wuzhu Courtyard.

775
00:39:07,670 --> 00:39:10,320
Second Madam's gone mad
and has been sent to a suburban estate.

776
00:39:10,320 --> 00:39:12,360
If something happens to
Third Madam as well,

777
00:39:12,360 --> 00:39:13,110
I'm afraid

778
00:39:13,590 --> 00:39:15,030
the disgrace brought upon
the Xie family will be far greater

779
00:39:15,030 --> 00:39:16,760
than the things
Eldest Sister and I have done.

780
00:39:16,760 --> 00:39:19,260
I know you are furious right now, Father,

781
00:39:19,360 --> 00:39:21,150
but this matter carries too much weight.

782
00:39:21,150 --> 00:39:22,880
I feel I must advise against it.

783
00:39:29,760 --> 00:39:32,030
What fine twisted logic.

784
00:39:32,510 --> 00:39:33,960
By your reasoning,

785
00:39:34,440 --> 00:39:36,920
after all this commotion,

786
00:39:37,190 --> 00:39:39,550
we can't even punish

787
00:39:40,110 --> 00:39:41,550
Lian Fanqiao?

788
00:39:45,400 --> 00:39:47,400
Father, Grandmother, you blame me,

789
00:39:47,400 --> 00:39:49,000
and I have nothing to say to that.

790
00:39:49,000 --> 00:39:50,800
I am willing to accept punishment.

791
00:39:50,800 --> 00:39:51,480
Qingyuan,

792
00:39:52,550 --> 00:39:53,550
no need to beg him.

793
00:39:56,840 --> 00:39:58,110
In over 20 years...

794
00:40:00,920 --> 00:40:02,380
I've never felt more alive

795
00:40:03,150 --> 00:40:04,710
than I do right now.

796
00:40:06,880 --> 00:40:08,280
All these years,

797
00:40:09,360 --> 00:40:11,760
I never dared ask for
fine silks or jewelry,

798
00:40:13,360 --> 00:40:15,230
nor ask for love or affection.

799
00:40:15,920 --> 00:40:19,710
Even when my best friend was wronged,

800
00:40:20,510 --> 00:40:22,360
I could only stand by and watch,

801
00:40:24,190 --> 00:40:26,650
not daring to
utter a single word of protest.

802
00:40:27,000 --> 00:40:28,230
Because I know

803
00:40:29,590 --> 00:40:31,150
that in this household,

804
00:40:32,320 --> 00:40:34,280
there isn't a single living soul

805
00:40:35,070 --> 00:40:35,960
who doesn't

806
00:40:36,310 --> 00:40:38,710
swallow their own suffering in silence!

807
00:40:38,880 --> 00:40:39,630
Shut up!

808
00:40:39,630 --> 00:40:40,800
I'm not finished!

809
00:40:45,190 --> 00:40:46,880
You can bully me,

810
00:40:47,510 --> 00:40:50,150
but you cannot bully my daughter.

811
00:40:51,070 --> 00:40:53,360
All these years I've swallowed my pride
and endured everything

812
00:40:53,360 --> 00:40:55,190
just to keep her safe.

813
00:40:55,630 --> 00:40:57,030
She's not an object.

814
00:40:57,630 --> 00:40:58,960
And she certainly isn't

815
00:40:59,030 --> 00:41:01,150
a stepping stone
for you to climb the social ladder!

816
00:41:01,150 --> 00:41:02,110
Impertinent!

817
00:41:09,880 --> 00:41:10,880
Today,

818
00:41:12,800 --> 00:41:14,530
I've finally set my Qinghe free

819
00:41:15,510 --> 00:41:18,150
from this den of horrors
that devours people.

820
00:41:20,710 --> 00:41:22,190
I, Lian Fanqiao...

821
00:41:25,960 --> 00:41:27,670
have no regrets in this life.

822
00:41:34,030 --> 00:41:35,480
Kill me, torture me,

823
00:41:36,070 --> 00:41:37,470
or throw me into the pond—

824
00:41:39,960 --> 00:41:41,440
do as you please.

825
00:41:48,190 --> 00:41:49,280
I've had enough

826
00:41:51,110 --> 00:41:53,150
of this cage for far too long!
